     "source": "The *pîpal* tree grieves"
    },
    {
     "id": "p037.s08",
     "source": "By shedding its leaves;"
    },
    {
     "id": "p037.s09",
     "source": "The buffalo mourns"
    },
    {
     "id": "p037.s10",
     "source": "By casting her horns;"
    },
    {
     "id": "p037.s11",
     "source": "The stream, weeping fast,"
    },
    {
     "id": "p037.s12",
     "source": "Grows briny at last;"
    },
    {
     "id": "p037.s13",
     "source": "The cuckoo with sighs"
    },
    {
     "id": "p037.s14",
     "source": "Blinds one of its eyes!'"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p037"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p038.s01",
     "source": "'Bless my heart!' cried Bhagtu,'but that is simply the most heartrending tale I ever heard in my life!"
    },
    {
     "id": "p038.s02",
     "source": "I must really mourn likewise!'"
    },
    {
     "id": "p038.s03",
     "source": "Whereupon he wept, and wailed, and beat his breast, until he went completely out of his mind; and when the Queen's maidservant came to buy of him, he gave her pepper instead of turmeric, onion instead of garlic, and wheat instead of pulse."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p038"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p039.s01",
     "source": "'Dear me, friend Bhagtu!' quoth the maid-* servant, 'your wits are wool-gathering!"
    },
    {
     "id": "p039.s02",
     "source": "What's the matter?'"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p039"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p040.s01",
     "source": "'Don't! please don't!' cried Bhagtu; 'I wish you wouldn't ask me, for I am trying to forget all about it."
    },
    {
     "id": "p040.s02",
     "source": "It is too dreadful--too too terrible!'"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p040"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p041.s01",
     "source": "At last, however, yielding to the maid's entreaties, he replied, with many sobs and tears--"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p041"
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "segments": [
    {
