    },
    {
     "id": "p042.s13",
     "source": "The cuckoo with sighs"
    },
    {
     "id": "p042.s14",
     "source": "Blinds one of its eyes;"
    },
    {
     "id": "p042.s15",
     "source": "Bhagtu's grief so intense is,"
    },
    {
     "id": "p042.s16",
     "source": "He loses his senses!'"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p042"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p043.s01",
     "source": "'How very sad!' exclaimed the maidservant."
    },
    {
     "id": "p043.s02",
     "source": "'I don't wonder at your distress; but it is always so in this miserable world!--everything goes wrong!'"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p043"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p044.s01",
     "source": "Whereupon she fell to railing at everybody and everything in the world, until the Queen said to her, 'What is the matter, my child?"
    },
    {
     "id": "p044.s02",
     "source": "What distresses you?'"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p044"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p045.s01",
     "source": "'Oh!' replied the maidservant, 'the old story! every one is miserable, and I most of all!"
    },
    {
     "id": "p045.s02",
     "source": "Such dreadful news!--"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p045"
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p046.s01",
     "source": "'The ugly hen painted."
    },
    {
     "id": "p046.s02",
     "source": "By jealousy tainted,"
    },
    {
     "id": "p046.s03",
     "source": "The pretty hen dyed."
    },
    {
     "id": "p046.s04",
     "source": "Lamenting his bride,"
    },
